01:22:51,136 --> 01:22:53,636
(Paying for the outfit he liked as well)

2075
01:22:55,006 --> 01:22:57,546
- I'll wear this out. - Oh, okay.

2076
01:22:58,576 --> 01:23:01,246
In the end, the clothes I bought from that shop...

2077
01:23:01,846 --> 01:23:03,985
- wasn't too challenging, - Really?

2078
01:23:03,986 --> 01:23:06,485
- and I can wear them daily. - That's nice.

2079
01:23:06,486 --> 01:23:08,016
- You need to compromise. - Yes.

2080
01:23:08,756 --> 01:23:10,856
I think I have transformed.

2081
01:23:12,286 --> 01:23:13,696
- CODE KUNST. - Yes?

2082
01:23:13,796 --> 01:23:15,796
I want to take photos like you do.

2083
01:23:17,796 --> 01:23:19,465
- You want pretty photos? - Yes.

2084
01:23:19,466 --> 01:23:21,535
- Shall we go to a cafe? - Yes, let's go...

2085
01:23:21,536 --> 01:23:22,806
and drink something.

2086
01:23:23,306 --> 01:23:24,835
- Gosh, it's so... - They're cute.

2087
01:23:24,836 --> 01:23:25,866
Yes.

2088
01:23:30,776 --> 01:23:33,945
(He followed CODE KUNST into a cafe.)

2089
01:23:33,946 --> 01:23:34,946
Hello.

2090
01:23:35,576 --> 01:23:36,785
(Fascinated)

2091
01:23:36,786 --> 01:23:38,916
- This... - There was a fascinating cafe.

2092
01:23:39,516 --> 01:23:41,586
It's a cafe that gives off a good vibe.

2093
01:23:41,716 --> 01:23:43,755
- It's all about good vibes for him. - I'll have something sweet.

2094
01:23:43,756 --> 01:23:45,555
I'll have an iced vanilla latte.

2095
01:23:45,556 --> 01:23:46,696
An iced vanilla latte.

2096
01:23:46,826 --> 01:23:47,996
What would you like to drink?

2097
01:23:48,256 --> 01:23:49,825
I'll have an iced vanilla latte too.

2098
01:23:49,826 --> 01:23:50,866
Sure.

2099
01:23:52,366 --> 01:23:54,135
He doesn't drink coffee like that.

2100
01:23:54,136 --> 01:23:56,166
(He doesn't drink coffee like that.)

2101
01:23:56,436 --> 01:23:58,306
- About Instagram... - Yes?

2102
01:23:59,776 --> 01:24:01,236
I want to do it in earnest.

2103
01:24:02,976 --> 01:24:05,106
So you want to take a photo here?

2104
01:24:05,546 --> 01:24:06,546
(Nodding)

2105
01:24:06,916 --> 01:24:08,045
You have an Instagram account.

2106
01:24:08,046 --> 01:24:10,246
I was about to delete everything...

2107
01:24:10,646 --> 01:24:13,255
and start anew.

2108
01:24:13,256 --> 01:24:15,685
So I wanted to start it in a cool way.

2109
01:24:15,686 --> 01:24:17,085
You can fill it with photos like that.

2110
01:24:17,086 --> 01:24:18,225
- Yes. - That's right.

2111
01:24:18,226 --> 01:24:20,696
You two should meet regularly.

2112
01:24:21,056 --> 01:24:22,196
Sit here.

2113
01:24:25,296 --> 01:24:26,635
- Is it cool? - Yes.

2114
01:24:26,636 --> 01:24:28,696
(The teacher found the perfect photo spot.)

2115
01:24:29,536 --> 01:24:30,636
Gosh, this is nice.

2116
01:24:33,076 --> 01:24:34,076
(Focused)

2117
01:24:34,436 --> 01:24:35,536
Try something more...

2118
01:24:36,546 --> 01:24:38,375
(Tilting his head)

2119
01:24:38,376 --> 01:24:39,576
I got it. Hold on.

2120
01:24:40,576 --> 01:24:42,215
I always did a V-sign when taking photos.

2121
01:24:42,216 --> 01:24:44,585
But I met CODE KUNST...

2122
01:24:44,586 --> 01:24:46,616
so I could change.

2123
01:24:47,216 --> 01:24:49,115
I'm going to keep trying to change.

2124
01:24:49,116 --> 01:24:50,516
(A fool who could only do a V-sign)

2125
01:24:50,956 --> 01:24:52,486
I think CODE KUNST...

2126
01:24:53,196 --> 01:24:56,626
gives off a vibe like this.

2127
01:24:57,326 --> 01:24:58,966
He'd go, "Gosh, I'm tired."

2128
01:24:59,536 --> 01:25:00,766
Something like this.

2129
01:25:01,566 --> 01:25:03,906
To follow CODE KUNST, I should go like this.

2130
01:25:04,406 --> 01:25:06,206
(A perfect copy)

2131
01:25:06,276 --> 01:25:07,276
Like this.

2132
01:25:07,277 --> 01:25:08,535
(He's done analyzing CODE KUNST.)

2133
01:25:08,536 --> 01:25:10,016
Does it look like a fashion magazine?

2134
01:25:10,746 --> 01:25:12,606
I thought I should relax...

2135
01:25:13,216 --> 01:25:15,216
to get photos with a nice vibe.

2136
01:25:15,576 --> 01:25:17,616
- There you go. - He's getting the vibe.

2137
01:25:21,516 --> 01:25:23,585
Ji Hyeon used to like going fishing with me.

2138
01:25:23,586 --> 01:25:25,186
That's good.

2139
01:25:27,056 --> 01:25:28,226
What a pretty car.

2140
01:25:29,896 --> 01:25:31,096
What do you think?

2141
01:25:32,366 --> 01:25:33,965
(CODE KUNST does his best so Ji Hyeon can get a nice photo.)

2142
01:25:33,966 --> 01:25:35,996
(Click)

2143
01:25:36,606 --> 01:25:37,865
Let's choose now.

2144
01:25:37,866 --> 01:25:39,606
(Let's choose a photo.)

2145
01:25:41,436 --> 01:25:42,536
(Approaching)

2146
01:25:43,106 --> 01:25:45,776
Wait! This looks sick.

2147
01:25:45,846 --> 01:25:46,916
"Sick?"

2148
01:25:47,016 --> 01:25:48,645
I think it's cooler when my face isn't showing much.

2149
01:25:48,646 --> 01:25:50,716
(Sliding)

2150
01:25:52,186 --> 01:25:54,716
(Best photos created by CODE KUNST)

2151
01:25:54,856 --> 01:25:56,585
- This one looks good. - The one on the right looks good.

2152
01:25:56,586 --> 01:25:58,526
It gives off a mysterious vibe.

2153
01:26:00,696 --> 01:26:02,696
I think a fashion sense...

2154
01:26:03,766 --> 01:26:06,166
is about balance.

2155
01:26:06,636 --> 01:26:08,236
You can't wear tracksuits...

2156
01:26:08,596 --> 01:26:11,406
and pose like CODE KUNST.

2157
01:26:13,106 --> 01:26:17,806
I was really grateful to CODE KUNST today.

2158
01:26:17,946 --> 01:26:18,975
Seriously.

2159
01:26:18,976 --> 01:26:20,916
He came to my place...

2160
01:26:21,076 --> 01:26:23,386
and checked my dressing room too.

2161
01:26:23,516 --> 01:26:26,316
Then he went shopping with me and picked clothes for me.

2162
01:26:26,716 --> 01:26:28,485
I've opened up to him.

2163
01:26:28,486 --> 01:26:29,786
(To CODE KUNST)

2164
01:26:30,256 --> 01:26:31,776
(You don't have to knock on my heart.)

2165
01:26:33,226 --> 01:26:34,826
He should pave his own way now.

2166
01:26:35,156 --> 01:26:36,225
It's so different.

2167
01:26:36,226 --> 01:26:37,896
He should go forward by himself.

2168
01:26:38,196 --> 01:26:39,396
You're drawing a line again.

2169
01:26:40,236 --> 01:26:43,236
There must be a reason people love Ji Hyeon.

2170
01:26:43,766 --> 01:26:46,736
I don't think it's always a gain to change oneself.

2171
01:26:47,906 --> 01:26:50,776
That was such a good lesson.

2172
01:26:51,446 --> 01:26:53,415
Right? The left side of my face...

2173
01:26:53,416 --> 01:26:54,416
The more I see him in a beanie,

2174
01:26:54,417 --> 01:26:55,445
- the better it suits him. - It suits him.

2175
01:26:55,446 --> 01:26:57,946
It looks way better than when he put it on for the first time.

2176
01:27:01,386 --> 01:27:05,226
(A Day with a Good Vibe)

2177
01:27:05,326 --> 01:27:06,826
(Next story)

2178
01:27:07,726 --> 01:27:09,665
(Sung Hwan appears in a huge van.)

2179
01:27:09,666 --> 01:27:10,666
(Hey, get in!)

2180
01:27:10,667 --> 01:27:12,496
(The 1st Rainbow Club Summer Retreat)

2181
01:27:13,266 --> 01:27:15,496
(It's the day of our retreat!)

2182
01:27:16,566 --> 01:27:18,236
(Let's go with Driver Ku!)

2183
01:27:19,006 --> 01:27:23,076
(Entering the retreat place with excited hearts)

2184
01:27:23,606 --> 01:27:24,905
(The theme of this retreat...)

2185
01:27:24,906 --> 01:27:25,906
(is cooperation.)

2186
01:27:26,746 --> 01:27:28,466
(A day the Rainbow Club members become one)

2187
01:27:29,176 --> 01:27:31,616
(They make lunch together with the ingredients they brought.)

2188
01:27:32,646 --> 01:27:33,656
(Next!)

2189
01:27:33,816 --> 01:27:36,386
(White bags that give off a bad feeling)

2190
01:27:37,286 --> 01:27:38,286
(You scared me!)

2191
01:27:38,726 --> 01:27:40,326
(That's enough!)

2192
01:27:40,826 --> 01:27:42,546
(The rule is to add whatever they brought.)

2193
01:27:43,566 --> 01:27:47,665
(Don't forget. We're one!)

2194
01:27:47,666 --> 01:27:48,666
- Ready, go. - Go.

2195
01:27:48,667 --> 01:27:50,306
(We're stronger when we're together.)

2196
01:27:51,066 --> 01:27:53,736
(A place of harmony and mutual care)

2197
01:27:55,006 --> 01:27:56,606
(A retreat where they sleep together...)

2198
01:27:56,776 --> 01:27:58,476
(and play together)

2199
01:27:59,776 --> 01:28:02,346
(The highlight of retreats, talent show)

2200
01:28:03,716 --> 01:28:06,146
(The old-school retreat vibe)

2201
01:28:06,886 --> 01:28:08,355
(The prize for 1st place...)

2202
01:28:08,356 --> 01:28:10,637
(is an opening performance for the Entertainment Awards.)

2203
01:28:11,126 --> 01:28:12,856
(Moomoo time to get things in line)

2204
01:28:13,456 --> 01:28:14,556
(Screaming)

2205
01:28:15,396 --> 01:28:18,266
(They've been waiting for tonight only.)

2206
01:28:18,526 --> 01:28:21,336
(I'll show you everything I prepared.)

2207
01:28:22,296 --> 01:28:23,336
(Moved)

2208
01:28:24,106 --> 01:28:26,005
(Getting sentimental as it's a retreat)

2209
01:28:26,006 --> 01:28:27,006
(Teary-eyed)

2210
01:28:27,436 --> 01:28:29,316
(A moment when Rainbow Club members become one)

2211
01:28:29,606 --> 01:28:33,316
(This is the power of teamwork.)

2212
01:28:33,546 --> 01:28:36,016
(We're really happy.)

2213
01:28:37,516 --> 01:28:39,656
(The 1st Rainbow Club Retreat)
